{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國沃金一名不願公開姓名的退休油漆工兼裝飾工，將一批在閣樓存放約15年的寶可夢卡牌送交Ewbank's拍賣。整批藏品總成交額達到156萬英鎊，約合209萬美元，刷新了該拍賣行三十年歷史中的紀錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583558.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.768790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"92f2930dc5073d661a5e38378ea91f59e01740a285b4f3859544a6ca1659cdf0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}